    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIaAtr">VIIa Atr</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ealle we beþurfan þæt we geornlice earnian þæt we Godes miltse ⁊ his mildheortnesse habban moton ⁊ þæt we þurh his fultum magon feondum wiðstandan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">All of us have need to strive earnestly that we may obtain the mercy and compassion of God and through his help withstand our foes.</ab>
      </div>
